No seats, no minimums. Buy separately and run against self-hosted dbt, or add to a dbt platform plan. View rates and billing details.

dbt State

dbt State simplifies orchestration and saves you on compute. With every run, it builds only what changed and skips the rest by reusing, cloning or auto-deferring.

You are billed for each daily unique reuse of a model, test, or snapshot per day (Daily Active Target Tables, or DATT).

30 day free trial

Pay-as-you-go: $0.094 / DATT

Custom pricing available for upfront commits: contact sales

